quran[5]{c,v,t}:
  5,109,"The Day when Allah will gather the messengers and say: ‘What response did you receive?’ They will say: ‘We have no knowledge (compared to You). Indeed, You are the Great Knower of all unseen things.’"
  5,110,"When Allah will say: ‘O ‘Isa, son of Maryam (Jesus, son of Mary), remember My blessing upon you, and upon your mother when I strengthened you with the Holy Spirit so that you would speak to the people in the cradle and adulthood, and when I taught you the Scripture, Wisdom, the Torah and the Injil (the Gospel), and when you would create from clay the shape of a bird by My permission, and you would breathe into it and it would become a (flying) bird by My permission, and you would heal the blind and the leper by My permission and you would bring the dead back to life by My permission. And when I restrained the Children of Israel from (killing) you while you brought them clear proofs, but the disbelievers among them said: ‘This is nothing but clear magic.’"
  5,111,"And when I inspired the disciples to believe in Me and My messenger (‘Isa [Jesus]), they said: ‘We believe and bear witness that we submit to God entirely (i.e. that we are Muslims).’"
  5,112,"When the disciples said: ‘O ‘Isa, son of Maryam (Jesus, son of Mary)! Can your Lord send down to us a feast (i.e. a table spread with food) from heaven?’ ‘Isa (Jesus) said: ‘Be conscious of Allah if you are (true) believers.’"
  5,113,"They said: ‘We desire to eat from it so that our hearts will be at peace, and we shall know that you have told us the truth, and we shall be among the witnesses to it.’"
